{%- doc -%}
  Outputs the id of the colour scheme shared by the page background, the header and the footer
  on the home page, content pages, policies and the 404 page (theme setting "home_color_scheme").
  Outputs nothing on every other page (shop, product, Brands, brand, search, cart), which keeps
  the first colour scheme; the header and footer then use their own colour scheme setting.

  @example
  {%- capture bs_page_scheme -%}{%- render 'bs-page-scheme' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  case request.page_type
    when 'index', 'page', 'policy', '404'
      echo settings.home_color_scheme
  endcase
-%}
